d": 1849730, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13n9e.jpg"}, {"id": 1849731, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13n9f.jpg"}, {"id": 1854311, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13qsn.jpg"}, {"id": 1854312, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13qso.jpg"}, {"id": 1854313, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13qsp.jpg"}, {"id": 1854314, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13qsq.jpg"}, {"id": 1854315, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13qsr.jpg"}, {"id": 1854316, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13qss.jpg"}], "slug": "can-i-take-your-order", "storyline": "You're a part time waiters taking gigs in different restaurants.\n\nYour job is to deal with the customers and keep them happy. Bring them food before they get angry. Get rid of the rat that's bothering people. Stop a shootout before someone gets hurt. Taze the Alien that is about to abduct one of your customers.\nAccidents do happen, so make sure to dispose of the bodies before people start complaining about the smell.\n\nDo everything well and get a juicy tip! Do it poorly and get fired.\n\nUse your tips to buy and upgrade tools and equipment to make your job easier, such as a fire extinguisher to stop fires from spreading, or a Taser to rapidly deescalate the situation, and many more.\n\nCrazy and random events keep happening in the restaurants you work in, so you will need to be on your toes in order to keep your customers happy.", "summary": "You and your friends play as part time waiters in different restaurants. Use your bare hands to deliver food, taze a raging cowboy who just shot someone and dispose of the body before it starts to stink. Keep your customers happy on your own, or with up to 3 friends in online co-op.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 40, "name": "Party"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/can-i-take